WEBVTT

01:40.660 --> 01:44.200
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.050 --> 01:47.140
[Episode 23]

01:51.479 --> 01:52.350
Come with me.

01:56.039 --> 01:56.789
-Snitching, huh?
-Snitching, huh?

01:56.789 --> 01:57.840
-How dare you!
-How dare you!

01:57.840 --> 01:58.509
Stop!

02:05.120 --> 02:05.950
I want him.

02:46.670 --> 02:47.640
[Master Yan's Mansion]

03:01.550 --> 03:02.830
This isn't right.

03:02.310 --> 03:04.650
[Master Yan of the human race, Guan Zhi]

03:04.300 --> 03:06.180
Not right. Not right.

03:07.030 --> 03:08.080
Something's off.

03:08.080 --> 03:09.120
What's not right?

03:10.960 --> 03:11.750
Master.

03:12.000 --> 03:13.080
You came at the right time.

03:13.080 --> 03:14.190
Take a look at this drawing.

03:14.430 --> 03:15.400
Master.

03:15.630 --> 03:16.520
The servants told me

03:16.520 --> 03:17.360
that you haven't had

03:17.360 --> 03:18.870
a proper meal in days.

03:19.120 --> 03:20.710
Can't you eat first

03:20.710 --> 03:21.630
before working on the drawing?

03:21.840 --> 03:23.079
I can't even finish the drawing.

03:23.079 --> 03:24.560
How can I have the mood to eat?

03:25.079 --> 03:26.150
Come on, take a look.

03:39.030 --> 03:40.079
I've always said

03:40.560 --> 03:42.340
you're suited for learning craftsmanship.

03:42.590 --> 03:44.470
But you insist on taking over your father's position.

03:44.620 --> 03:45.970
What a waste of talent.

03:46.120 --> 03:48.030
There are thousands of craftsmen in Yandu City,

03:48.150 --> 03:50.190
and you have students all over the world, Master.

03:50.190 --> 03:51.520
You won't miss just one like me.

03:51.800 --> 03:52.590
But I'm my father's

03:52.590 --> 03:54.430
only son.

03:55.520 --> 03:56.310
Your father has obtained

03:56.310 --> 03:57.960
the immortal pill from the Youhu Clan.

03:58.110 --> 03:59.710
After he comes out of seclusion this time,

03:59.870 --> 04:01.590
he'll have several decades of good life ahead.

04:01.870 --> 04:03.240
Between you two,

04:03.400 --> 04:05.400
it's hard to say who will die first.

04:05.400 --> 04:06.910
You don't need to rush to take over.

04:07.560 --> 04:08.870
Master, your words...

04:09.680 --> 04:11.050
Are absolutely right.

04:11.910 --> 04:12.840
Of course, my father will

04:12.840 --> 04:14.030
live a long life.

04:14.150 --> 04:16.430
You too, Master.

04:16.800 --> 04:17.680
I'm not that blessed.

04:18.950 --> 04:20.750
I don't know if I'll ever have the chance

04:21.040 --> 04:22.310
in this lifetime

04:22.310 --> 04:24.800
to have a read of the Wushuang Secret Manual.

04:24.870 --> 04:26.600
Master, you're still looking for the Wushuang Secret Manual?

04:27.430 --> 04:28.950
Isn't that just a rumor?

04:29.390 --> 04:30.950
If that rumor is false,

04:31.920 --> 04:33.680
then these questions in my mind

04:34.720 --> 04:36.950
might never be resolved in this lifetime.

04:41.010 --> 04:41.930
Oh, by the way, Master.

04:42.430 --> 04:43.240
Has Shen Ying

04:43.630 --> 04:45.310
been here recently?

04:46.510 --> 04:48.270
He hasn't been here for quite some time.

04:51.560 --> 04:53.040
He's also your disciple.

04:53.159 --> 04:54.750
He used to serve you diligently

04:54.750 --> 04:55.870
and was very respectful.

04:57.000 --> 04:59.170
I suppose he must have been too busy lately.

05:00.390 --> 05:01.190
Why?

05:01.750 --> 05:02.920
Did he offend you?

05:03.630 --> 05:05.360
No, Master, you're being too serious.

05:05.480 --> 05:06.680
He brought Dai

05:06.680 --> 05:08.000
and the immortal pill back.

05:08.160 --> 05:10.000
It's fair to say his achievements are outstanding.

05:10.190 --> 05:11.750
Father has entrusted him with important responsibilities.

05:12.160 --> 05:13.040
Recently, in the city,

05:13.040 --> 05:14.870
he's also taken on the role of the Imperial Guard Commander.

05:14.930 --> 05:16.050
He's been very busy.

05:17.070 --> 05:18.680
Everyone's busy with their own affairs.

05:19.190 --> 05:20.000
That's good.

05:21.920 --> 05:24.040
What's in that box you brought?

05:24.960 --> 05:26.290
So mysterious.

05:26.750 --> 05:28.480
If I didn't ask, you wouldn't take it out, would you?

05:28.680 --> 05:30.430
On my way here, I passed by Qiju Pavilion

05:30.430 --> 05:31.360
and found it interesting.

05:31.360 --> 05:32.120
So I bought it.

05:33.580 --> 05:34.230
Master.

05:46.150 --> 05:48.710
Thriving and prosperous, making money hand over fist.

05:50.510 --> 05:51.820
Exquisite.

05:52.680 --> 05:53.480
Master.

05:53.820 --> 05:55.070
Even in a random utensil shop,

05:55.070 --> 05:56.650
we can find such craftsmanship.

05:57.000 --> 05:57.800
It shows that

05:58.000 --> 05:59.830
our race is full of talented individuals.

05:59.860 --> 06:01.470
There's great potential in craftsmanship.

06:02.720 --> 06:03.510
Master.

06:04.240 --> 06:06.040
As long as we work together with one heart and mind,

06:06.270 --> 06:07.480
given time,

06:07.510 --> 06:09.800
why should we worry about the human race not thriving?

06:10.250 --> 06:11.890
Exquisite.

06:14.750 --> 06:15.870
Truly exquisite.

06:27.370 --> 06:29.060
This is the house I've rented.

06:30.000 --> 06:30.800
Come on in.

06:32.659 --> 06:34.560
How is it? Not bad, right?

06:35.680 --> 06:36.680
It's really spacious.

06:37.750 --> 06:39.360
There are several rooms here.

06:39.360 --> 06:40.610
This one here is where I live.

06:40.630 --> 06:42.040
Those two are empty.

06:42.040 --> 06:43.240
I was thinking of renting them out,

06:43.240 --> 06:44.240
and you came.

06:44.240 --> 06:45.270
Isn't that a coincidence?

06:46.040 --> 06:47.720
They can all be cleaned up later.

06:53.390 --> 06:54.190
Look.

06:54.510 --> 06:55.510
How's this room?

06:59.360 --> 07:00.680
You can stay in this room.

07:03.480 --> 07:04.830
I just moved in not long ago,

07:04.830 --> 07:05.950
and I only cleaned up the main room.

07:05.950 --> 07:07.720
This room can be lived in after a quick clean.

07:08.110 --> 07:09.800
The owners of this place are surnamed Liu.

07:10.050 --> 07:11.490
They're also well acquainted with my family.

07:11.560 --> 07:13.800
Their entire family moved away recently,

07:13.800 --> 07:15.310
so this house became vacant.

07:15.480 --> 07:16.600
Knowing I wanted to rent a place,

07:16.600 --> 07:17.950
they rented it to me at a good price.

07:21.190 --> 07:22.240
This side room

07:22.240 --> 07:23.070
used to be

07:23.070 --> 07:23.960
where their second daughter lived.

07:23.980 --> 07:25.660
She liked to arrange flowers and plants.

07:26.190 --> 07:27.240
Those in the courtyard

07:27.240 --> 07:29.040
were also planted by that Miss Liu before.

07:29.120 --> 07:30.800
So this was a young lady's boudoir.

07:35.120 --> 07:36.000
Sir.

07:37.040 --> 07:39.040
Just stay here comfortably and recover.

07:39.330 --> 07:40.530
You're Tanyin's friend,

07:40.560 --> 07:41.680
which makes you my friend too.

07:42.310 --> 07:43.480
In one's lifetime,

07:43.630 --> 07:44.390
everyone has difficult times

07:44.390 --> 07:45.430
when the path ahead seems narrow.

07:45.430 --> 07:47.070
Hold your breath and endure it.

07:47.159 --> 07:49.120
With a broad mind, the world becomes broad.

07:51.070 --> 07:52.270
Thank you, Xue.

07:52.390 --> 07:54.190
We'll pay you the rent.

07:56.190 --> 07:57.000
Alright.

07:57.240 --> 07:58.310
If I don't let you pay,

07:58.310 --> 07:59.720
you probably won't feel comfortable staying here.

07:59.800 --> 08:00.600
Don't worry.

08:00.680 --> 08:02.240
I'll definitely take good care of him.

08:02.630 --> 08:03.900
I'll go make some delicious food.

08:04.010 --> 08:05.330
Have dinner here, alright?

08:10.160 --> 08:11.680
You wait here for a moment.

08:11.680 --> 08:12.830
I'll go tidy up a bit.

08:22.000 --> 08:22.950
You've finished cleaning?

08:23.120 --> 08:24.270
Do you need my help?

08:24.270 --> 08:25.830
No need, you rest.

08:25.830 --> 08:26.950
Just relax and wait for dinner.

08:28.680 --> 08:29.480
Tanyin,

08:30.040 --> 08:30.950
who is he?

08:31.360 --> 08:32.870
He's kind of a friend of mine.

08:32.960 --> 08:33.640
His name is Qian Lin.

08:33.659 --> 08:34.630
Qian Lin?

08:34.960 --> 08:36.390
That's quite a nice name.

08:36.720 --> 08:38.270
I noticed he doesn't talk much.

08:38.270 --> 08:39.789
He wasn't like this before.

08:40.320 --> 08:41.150
Don't worry.

08:41.150 --> 08:42.480
I'll take good care of him.

08:42.480 --> 08:43.960
He probably won't stay for long.

08:44.030 --> 08:45.490
I'll make time to come over every day.

08:45.750 --> 08:47.550
Xue, sorry for the trouble.

08:48.270 --> 08:49.420
There's no trouble at all.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.550
Xue bought a set of old clothes

09:12.550 --> 09:13.720
from the neighbor next door.

09:13.720 --> 09:15.030
You can change into them later.

09:22.240 --> 09:23.030
Qian Lin.

09:23.440 --> 09:24.670
We've come to know each other.

09:24.750 --> 09:25.840
Since I met you,

09:25.840 --> 09:27.320
I won't turn a blind eye.

09:27.390 --> 09:28.240
If you're willing,

09:28.240 --> 09:29.390
you can stay.

09:29.840 --> 09:31.550
If you don't want to and wish to leave,

09:31.600 --> 09:32.550
you're also free to do so.

09:36.600 --> 09:37.750
Get some rest first.

09:38.390 --> 09:39.910
You're letting me stay just like this?

09:42.510 --> 09:43.550
I am a War Demon.

09:45.270 --> 09:46.480
So what if you're a War Demon?

09:47.100 --> 09:48.610
War Demons are people too.

10:13.550 --> 10:15.360
Take care, you two. Please come again.

10:15.360 --> 10:16.000
Okay.

10:18.880 --> 10:19.670
Sir,

10:20.120 --> 10:21.320
are you waiting for someone?

10:23.270 --> 10:25.000
You must be waiting for your wife, right?

10:28.960 --> 10:30.790
You're truly blessed, Sir.

10:30.790 --> 10:31.720
Your wife

10:31.720 --> 10:33.480
is both gentle and virtuous.

10:33.480 --> 10:35.000
She leaves early and returns late every day.

10:35.000 --> 10:37.120
I heard she works at Qiju Pavilion

10:37.120 --> 10:38.510
as a craftsman, right?

10:39.390 --> 10:40.580
That's impressive. Truly impressive.

10:40.670 --> 10:42.080
This is really enviable.

10:45.420 --> 10:46.420
Oh, by the way, Sir,

10:46.840 --> 10:48.000
it's raining outside.

10:48.000 --> 10:49.390
Did you bring an umbrella?

11:11.980 --> 11:13.270
♫Listening♫

11:13.290 --> 11:16.790
♫Toona leaves knock fireflies into a vase♫

11:16.810 --> 11:19.780
♫Ripples faintly spreading♫

11:20.680 --> 11:22.040
♫In the pavilion in the clouds♫

11:22.070 --> 11:24.030
♫Warm wine brews to the sound of the zither♫

11:24.230 --> 11:28.690
♫The fragrance lingers like brush strokes, sketching out your form♫

11:29.420 --> 11:30.580
♫Tonight♫

11:30.740 --> 11:34.600
♫In a light intoxication, I feel the longing in the crystalline snow♫

11:34.620 --> 11:37.470
♫I cannot bear to think of you♫

11:36.960 --> 11:37.750
Yuanzhong!

11:37.860 --> 11:39.500
♫I only wish♫

11:39.520 --> 11:41.350
♫That the years would remain ever sunny♫

11:39.870 --> 11:40.600
What's this?

11:40.600 --> 11:42.480
It's a treasure basin. I just bought it.

11:41.760 --> 11:45.930
♫So that, within the drifting light, I could share the breeze with you♫

11:44.720 --> 11:45.960
Are you here to pick me up?

11:46.480 --> 11:47.360
Where's Xiu?

11:46.540 --> 11:47.510
♫The wind blows♫

11:47.360 --> 11:48.200
At the noodle shop.

11:47.530 --> 11:48.930
♫It stirs the scenery♫

11:48.360 --> 11:49.910
You left him there alone?

11:49.140 --> 11:50.680
♫It awakens our heart♫

11:49.910 --> 11:51.120
Aren't you worried he might get lost?

11:50.700 --> 11:54.350
♫It makes me certain that you are my destiny♫

11:51.120 --> 11:52.240
You wish.

11:52.320 --> 11:53.200
Who would steal him?

11:54.980 --> 11:56.220
♫The closer we get♫

11:55.630 --> 11:56.440
Let's go.

11:56.240 --> 11:57.850
♫The more it feels like a dream♫

11:57.870 --> 11:59.240
♫And the more I look intoxicated♫

11:59.270 --> 12:03.590
♫I cannot fully express my yearning for you♫

12:03.720 --> 12:04.720
♫The wind blows♫

12:04.740 --> 12:06.500
♫It blows away the shadows of the clouds♫

12:06.540 --> 12:08.200
♫It makes the moon seem even brighter♫

12:08.220 --> 12:12.400
♫It makes me wake up from a dream♫

12:12.420 --> 12:13.650
♫The wind blows♫

12:13.680 --> 12:15.270
♫It reddens my eyes♫

12:15.300 --> 12:17.300
♫It warms the promise we made♫

12:17.400 --> 12:20.930
♫In the wind, we gently♫

12:20.960 --> 12:23.640
♫Drift into a better place♫

12:33.600 --> 12:34.870
Young lady, you're back.

12:35.340 --> 12:36.980
Thank you for looking after Xiu for us.

12:38.550 --> 12:39.910
So the little one is called Xiu?

12:40.000 --> 12:41.090
He looks sturdy and strong.

12:41.120 --> 12:42.150
Quite adorable.

12:42.480 --> 12:43.100
Oh, by the way,

12:43.270 --> 12:45.000
are you two having noodles today as well?

12:45.870 --> 12:46.510
Yes.

12:46.600 --> 12:47.260
Alright then.

12:51.390 --> 12:52.750
I got paid today.

12:52.840 --> 12:53.840
Although I spent some,

12:53.840 --> 12:55.030
there's still quite a bit left.

12:55.140 --> 12:55.860
I went and

12:55.890 --> 12:57.130
exchanged it for gold beans.

13:02.230 --> 13:03.060
Today, Xiu

13:03.080 --> 13:04.660
can finally eat a bit more.

13:07.960 --> 13:09.030
You go sit down first.

13:09.290 --> 13:10.090
I'll go wash my hands.

13:10.530 --> 13:11.090
Okay.

13:47.220 --> 13:48.220
Your noodles are here.

13:48.240 --> 13:48.970
Thank you.

13:50.000 --> 13:50.910
What's wrong with him?

13:51.790 --> 13:53.120
He ate the gold beans but didn't get full,

13:53.190 --> 13:54.190
and now he's throwing a tantrum.

13:55.030 --> 13:56.510
Do we really not need to go look for him?

13:56.670 --> 13:57.370
It's alright.

13:57.480 --> 13:58.120
After he's done with his tantrum,

13:58.120 --> 13:59.150
he'll be back soon.

13:59.170 --> 13:59.960
Let's eat the noodles.

14:07.890 --> 14:08.570
Tell me,

14:08.600 --> 14:10.170
why doesn't he grow no matter how much he eats?

14:12.270 --> 14:13.720
Why do you want him to grow up?

14:16.870 --> 14:17.840
Why, you ask?

14:18.510 --> 14:19.270
Aren't we staying here

14:19.270 --> 14:21.030
in order to raise him?

14:25.750 --> 14:26.670
What's wrong?

14:27.480 --> 14:28.270
Nothing.

14:31.000 --> 14:32.630
I guess I'm still not earning enough.

14:33.080 --> 14:34.320
If children don't eat well,

14:34.500 --> 14:35.740
their health will suffer.

14:36.720 --> 14:37.630
He's a weapon spirit,

14:37.960 --> 14:38.960
not a child.

14:45.870 --> 14:46.670
Yuanzhong.

14:47.790 --> 14:48.600
Yuanzhong!

14:49.270 --> 14:50.840
Yuanzhong! Yuan-

14:52.540 --> 14:54.000
I've finally found you.

15:02.300 --> 15:04.450
So this... This is your-

15:04.510 --> 15:05.030
You two-

15:05.030 --> 15:06.550
He's a weapon spirit, named Xiu.

15:09.500 --> 15:10.740
Oh, so he's a weapon spirit.

15:10.940 --> 15:12.490
Looks quite cute.

15:12.840 --> 15:13.550
How did you think of

15:13.550 --> 15:14.490
coming to Yandu to find me?

15:14.630 --> 15:16.120
I originally came down the mountain

15:16.230 --> 15:18.080
to find a place for cultivation.

15:18.080 --> 15:18.750
But unexpectedly,

15:18.750 --> 15:20.120
I ran into Zi Fei and the others on the way.

15:20.120 --> 15:21.600
That guy asked me to come help you.

15:21.600 --> 15:22.390
He said when he left,

15:22.390 --> 15:23.550
he didn't leave you enough money,

15:23.670 --> 15:24.790
so he asked me to bring you some.

15:25.790 --> 15:27.440
That's really kind of you. Thank you so much.

15:27.720 --> 15:28.910
Now that we have money,

15:29.150 --> 15:30.540
Xiu can finally eat his fill.

15:33.240 --> 15:34.350
How did you find me?

15:34.840 --> 15:36.240
How did I find you?

15:36.240 --> 15:38.030
I've been wandering around the city for several days.

15:38.030 --> 15:38.720
I just ran into

15:38.720 --> 15:39.620
this child on the road.

15:39.640 --> 15:40.240
Right,

15:40.320 --> 15:41.390
I smelled your scent on him.

15:41.390 --> 15:42.420
I followed the scent all the way here.

15:43.200 --> 15:44.630
What a dog nose you have.

15:47.210 --> 15:48.020
Xiu!

15:48.080 --> 15:48.840
Xiu!

15:52.720 --> 15:53.360
He ran away?

15:54.320 --> 15:55.120
Xiu!

15:57.910 --> 15:58.790
Whose child is this?

15:58.790 --> 15:59.750
I'm sorry.

16:00.080 --> 16:00.790
Xiu!

16:00.790 --> 16:01.790
What's going on?

16:01.790 --> 16:02.600
Xiu!

16:05.790 --> 16:06.480
My wine!

16:06.480 --> 16:07.270
You've caused trouble again.

16:07.270 --> 16:08.000
Pay for it!

16:08.000 --> 16:09.080
I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

16:09.120 --> 16:10.360
I'll compensate you.

16:11.040 --> 16:12.350
Quick, give me the money pouch.

16:14.550 --> 16:15.360
It's gone.

16:16.840 --> 16:18.240
Xiu, spit it out now.

16:18.720 --> 16:19.440
Xiu, listen to me.

16:19.440 --> 16:20.600
Spit it out right now. Be a good boy.

16:20.620 --> 16:21.660
Or I'll have to spank you.

16:24.080 --> 16:25.440
This little guy has really caused trouble.

16:25.440 --> 16:29.360
Yeah, what kind of upbringing is this?

16:31.120 --> 16:32.110
Let me tell you something.

16:32.110 --> 16:33.440
You can't just eat without growing taller.

16:33.440 --> 16:34.240
You understand?

16:34.360 --> 16:35.720
You need to grow up quickly.

16:37.670 --> 16:38.610
Here, this is for you.

16:42.000 --> 16:43.270
This isn't for eating.

16:43.870 --> 16:45.120
This is for playing with.

16:45.120 --> 16:46.690
It's not made of gold, you know?

17:01.370 --> 17:02.300
Yuanzhong, look.

17:05.640 --> 17:06.440
Yuanzhong.

17:08.720 --> 17:09.510
Yuanzhong?

17:21.480 --> 17:22.270
Oh, right.

17:22.440 --> 17:23.839
Zi Fei asked me to pass on a message to you.

17:24.589 --> 17:25.680
He said that after they break Ling Yao's

17:25.680 --> 17:26.640
seal,

17:26.640 --> 17:28.069
they'll go to the Five Extremities on their own.

17:28.200 --> 17:29.480
They won't come to meet you.

17:30.960 --> 17:32.960
But even if they didn't come,

17:33.380 --> 17:34.340
I had to come see you.

17:35.310 --> 17:36.070
Otherwise, next time,

17:36.070 --> 17:36.990
I might not see you again.

17:40.490 --> 17:42.090
When little Xiu grows up,

17:42.750 --> 17:44.030
you'll begin, right?

17:45.960 --> 17:46.750
Yuanzhong.

17:47.480 --> 17:48.540
Have you really made up your mind?

18:10.900 --> 18:12.820
Sir, what would you like to eat?

18:13.270 --> 18:14.160
Same as them.

18:14.160 --> 18:14.880
Got it.

18:27.270 --> 18:29.120
Darling, I'm back.

18:53.310 --> 18:54.680
Why haven't you come home so late?

18:54.720 --> 18:56.160
Xiu is already asleep.

18:57.500 --> 18:59.740
I couldn't sleep, so I came out to find something to eat.

19:00.920 --> 19:01.640
At this hour,

19:01.640 --> 19:03.070
there are still so many customers here.

19:03.750 --> 19:04.550
Yes.

19:05.200 --> 19:06.640
The proprietress has been busy without a break.

19:07.750 --> 19:09.750
This is the unique hustle and bustle of Yandu.

19:10.590 --> 19:12.400
Madam, a bowl of wontons, please.

19:12.400 --> 19:12.980
Sure.

19:19.880 --> 19:21.160
What's wrong? You're not talking.

19:23.110 --> 19:24.440
This place is quite nice.

19:24.880 --> 19:26.000
You have a great eye for picking places.

19:27.460 --> 19:28.030
Is that so?

19:29.200 --> 19:30.750
I've been sitting here for three quarters of an hour,

19:31.110 --> 19:32.420
and the proprietress has been busy for three quarters of an hour.

19:33.110 --> 19:34.310
During this time,

19:34.310 --> 19:35.270
her baby in the cradle

19:35.270 --> 19:36.310
cried twice,

19:36.400 --> 19:37.400
and the slightly older child

19:37.400 --> 19:38.550
broke a bowl.

19:38.680 --> 19:40.240
The proprietress has been so busy that she hasn't had a moment to rest.

19:40.310 --> 19:41.920
She's been tending to the children while running the business,

19:42.200 --> 19:43.160
and hasn't stopped to rest

19:43.160 --> 19:44.160
for even a moment.

19:45.200 --> 19:46.110
Her husband

19:46.440 --> 19:47.750
came back reeking of alcohol,

19:48.240 --> 19:49.200
not only refusing to help,

19:49.640 --> 19:51.200
but nearly overturning the stall.

19:51.480 --> 19:53.000
He looks like a leisurely customer,

19:53.400 --> 19:54.070
acting absolutely not

19:54.070 --> 19:54.880
like he should

19:54.880 --> 19:55.960
as the man of the house.

19:56.240 --> 19:57.960
All these trivial matters

19:58.110 --> 19:59.110
are enough to weigh her down,

19:59.110 --> 20:00.070
leaving her no peace.

20:00.880 --> 20:03.000
Well, I think many things

20:03.000 --> 20:04.400
can't be judged at first glance.

20:04.680 --> 20:06.030
Look at this husband.

20:06.400 --> 20:08.640
Although his clothes are old and worn,

20:08.750 --> 20:09.830
even patched up,

20:09.880 --> 20:10.640
his wife

20:10.640 --> 20:11.960
and the two children's clothes

20:11.960 --> 20:13.720
look much newer in comparison.

20:14.090 --> 20:14.850
His feet

20:14.880 --> 20:16.320
are covered in mud and water,

20:16.590 --> 20:18.310
and his whole body is covered in dust.

20:18.750 --> 20:19.830
He looks like

20:19.830 --> 20:20.880
someone who does hard labor.

20:21.440 --> 20:23.160
Although he smells of alcohol,

20:23.480 --> 20:24.790
it seems

20:25.640 --> 20:27.200
more like medicinal wine.

20:27.350 --> 20:28.110
Perhaps he

20:28.110 --> 20:29.680
finished a hard day's work,

20:29.680 --> 20:30.680
applied some medicinal wine,

20:30.680 --> 20:31.680
and due to exhaustion,

20:31.850 --> 20:33.040
he fell asleep.

20:33.790 --> 20:35.480
You always find a way

20:35.960 --> 20:37.790
to see the better side of things.

20:38.350 --> 20:39.680
Because even though there are

20:39.680 --> 20:40.750
many bad people in this world,

20:40.830 --> 20:42.440
there are also plenty of good ones.

20:44.720 --> 20:45.510
Madam.

20:45.920 --> 20:46.720
Coming.

20:49.510 --> 20:50.720
Business is really good, isn't it?

20:51.310 --> 20:52.720
It's always busiest at this time of day.

20:52.720 --> 20:54.000
The craftsmen from the workshops finish their work,

20:54.000 --> 20:54.640
and they come straight here

20:54.640 --> 20:55.720
for some warm food.

20:55.880 --> 20:57.240
Is that your husband?

20:57.510 --> 20:58.400
Why does he let you

20:58.400 --> 20:59.550
work so hard all by yourself?

20:59.720 --> 21:01.640
Oh, him? He's exhausted from working all day.

21:01.640 --> 21:02.590
I asked him to go home and get some good rest,

21:02.590 --> 21:03.310
but he wouldn't.

21:03.310 --> 21:04.550
He insisted on coming here to keep me company,

21:04.680 --> 21:05.750
so that we could close up later together

21:05.750 --> 21:06.830
and go home together.

21:09.240 --> 21:10.160
You see?

21:10.400 --> 21:11.960
Instead of guessing back and forth here,

21:11.960 --> 21:13.030
worrying yourself,

21:13.110 --> 21:14.960
why don't you just ask directly?

21:15.270 --> 21:16.200
Their life

21:16.200 --> 21:17.350
isn't as bad as you thought,

21:17.350 --> 21:18.160
right?

21:18.830 --> 21:20.270
The couple is loving,

21:20.440 --> 21:22.160
and the family is harmonious.

21:24.270 --> 21:25.070
So,

21:25.480 --> 21:26.640
what's really bothering you?

21:29.000 --> 21:30.750
Ever since we entered Yandu City,

21:31.550 --> 21:33.200
you've been preoccupied

21:33.240 --> 21:34.400
and gloomy.

21:35.310 --> 21:36.640
Is there something on your mind?

21:39.550 --> 21:40.920
Do you believe in fate?

21:41.750 --> 21:42.680
Fate?

21:44.400 --> 21:45.400
When I was born,

21:45.790 --> 21:46.750
the Elders of my clan

21:46.750 --> 21:47.750
read my fortune.

21:48.160 --> 21:50.330
They said my life is cursed by the Seven Killings,

21:50.480 --> 21:51.790
and I'm destined to encounter entanglements.

21:51.790 --> 21:53.200
My life would be turbulent

21:53.510 --> 21:54.640
and full of dangers.

21:54.960 --> 21:56.160
If I focus on doing good,

21:56.440 --> 21:57.830
perhaps in desperate situations,

21:57.880 --> 21:59.270
I might glimpse a chance for survival.

21:59.920 --> 22:02.480
But I must never give in to greed or attachment.

22:02.830 --> 22:03.920
Once I desire something,

22:04.240 --> 22:05.310
that chance for survival will vanish,

22:05.680 --> 22:07.400
and even greater misfortune will follow.

22:08.960 --> 22:09.750
Ji Tanyin.

22:10.240 --> 22:11.160
Don't always try

22:11.160 --> 22:12.270
to probe into others' minds

22:12.270 --> 22:13.510
to figure out what they're really thinking.

22:14.640 --> 22:15.440
After all,

22:16.230 --> 22:17.920
you're not exactly an honest person yourself.

23:15.750 --> 23:16.550
Ji Tanyin.

23:16.960 --> 23:17.880
Don't always try

23:17.880 --> 23:19.070
to probe into others' minds

23:19.070 --> 23:20.310
to figure out what they're really thinking.

23:20.440 --> 23:21.240
After all,

23:21.550 --> 23:23.240
you're not exactly an honest person yourself.

23:47.450 --> 23:51.030
[Dengyun House]

23:53.200 --> 23:56.340
[Painter, Fu Jiuyun]

24:28.200 --> 24:29.000
Xue.

24:29.830 --> 24:30.960
I bought you some treats.

24:30.960 --> 24:31.590
What?

24:31.880 --> 24:33.070
You bought me treats?

24:33.440 --> 24:34.410
What kind of treats?

24:34.480 --> 24:35.350
The sweet cake.

24:35.960 --> 24:37.390
I love that sweet cake.

24:37.750 --> 24:39.510
And this, plum wine.

24:39.920 --> 24:40.680
I'm afraid of getting drunk,

24:40.680 --> 24:41.680
so I've never dared to try it.

24:41.830 --> 24:43.610
It won't make you drunk. It's sweet.

24:43.630 --> 24:44.760
You'll definitely like it.

24:48.880 --> 24:49.880
Where's Qian Lin?

24:50.400 --> 24:52.480
Oh, him? He sleeps all day,

24:52.480 --> 24:53.880
hiding under the blanket, refusing to go out.

24:54.110 --> 24:55.030
I think

24:55.230 --> 24:56.880
he doesn't want me to go in and check on him.

24:57.880 --> 24:58.860
Does he eat?

24:59.310 --> 25:01.400
Yes, he eats everything I bring in.

25:01.400 --> 25:02.480
He eats as much as I bring,

25:02.480 --> 25:03.710
like he's a reincarnated hungry ghost or something.

25:04.750 --> 25:05.720
Thank you for everything.

25:06.070 --> 25:07.000
Don't mention it.

25:39.510 --> 25:40.350
You're awake.

25:41.750 --> 25:42.440
I've prepared

25:42.440 --> 25:43.640
some pastries for you.

25:43.710 --> 25:44.790
Come and try some.

25:51.070 --> 25:52.400
Why did you fall asleep here?

25:53.400 --> 25:54.960
Maybe I've been too tired lately.

25:56.610 --> 25:58.850
Did you have a fight with the High Priest?

25:59.550 --> 26:02.950
He seems to dislike me a bit lately.

26:03.310 --> 26:04.110
Why?

26:05.030 --> 26:06.750
Maybe because he thinks I'm not honest.

26:08.880 --> 26:10.030
Is he honest?

26:11.920 --> 26:12.920
Not really.

26:14.440 --> 26:15.830
Then he's no better than you.

26:15.830 --> 26:17.000
What right does he have to dislike you?

26:18.880 --> 26:19.830
It's different.

26:20.110 --> 26:21.400
Although he's not honest,

26:21.590 --> 26:23.440
I know everything about him.

26:24.270 --> 26:25.310
You know everything?

26:27.830 --> 26:28.960
I doubt that.

26:32.720 --> 26:34.070
Your magic source is broken?

26:37.480 --> 26:38.270
Yes.

26:39.920 --> 26:40.880
It's not a big deal.

26:41.790 --> 26:43.200
Being an ordinary person is quite good.

26:53.160 --> 26:54.240
I'll head back first.

26:55.350 --> 26:56.160
Ji Tanyin.

27:00.070 --> 27:01.200
Thank you for the pastries.

27:02.200 --> 27:03.240
Rest well.

27:21.680 --> 27:22.790
You're not angry anymore?

27:24.350 --> 27:26.270
When was I ever angry?

27:29.070 --> 27:31.200
Miss Ji, we meet again.

27:31.590 --> 27:32.510
Come on in.

27:32.510 --> 27:33.440
I'll treat you to a meal.

27:37.720 --> 27:39.270
These are all specialties of our small restaurant.

27:39.270 --> 27:40.830
Dear guests, please enjoy your meal.

27:42.920 --> 27:43.720
How do you like these?

27:43.750 --> 27:44.640
If you want to eat

27:44.640 --> 27:45.200
or drink something else,

27:45.200 --> 27:45.830
feel free to order.

27:45.830 --> 27:47.110
It's my treat today anyway.

27:47.550 --> 27:48.830
Thank you, Mei Shan.

27:49.590 --> 27:50.880
Don't mention it, Miss Ji.

27:50.960 --> 27:52.440
Well, one is my long-time old friend,

27:52.440 --> 27:54.240
and the other is someone who bore heavenly thunder together with me.

27:54.680 --> 27:56.240
A meal together is no big deal.

27:56.960 --> 27:58.310
Is this the first time

27:58.310 --> 28:00.000
you've been away from Baitou Mountain all these years?

28:00.240 --> 28:01.030
Yes, indeed.

28:01.590 --> 28:02.350
I've only stayed in the mountain

28:02.350 --> 28:03.920
for a mere few decades.

28:03.920 --> 28:05.070
I never expected the Mortal Realm

28:05.070 --> 28:07.000
to have changed so much.

28:08.680 --> 28:10.030
Come on, let's eat first,

28:10.030 --> 28:10.920
to fill our stomachs a bit.

28:10.920 --> 28:11.510
Today,

28:11.510 --> 28:13.240
I've also invited another friend.

28:13.440 --> 28:14.270
What friend?

28:14.410 --> 28:15.690
You'll see when he arrives.

28:21.400 --> 28:23.070
Look. Since you're trying this dish first,

28:23.070 --> 28:24.750
it's easy to tell you're not a local.

28:24.790 --> 28:26.680
This pouch pancake is the essence

28:26.680 --> 28:28.070
of this table's fare.

28:28.350 --> 28:29.240
As for this pouch pancake,

28:29.240 --> 28:31.070
locals call it "sack pancake."

28:31.240 --> 28:32.030
Since it's a "sack,"

28:32.150 --> 28:34.480
you have to fill it with vegetables.

28:35.240 --> 28:36.030
Like this.

28:37.590 --> 28:38.590
That's how it's best eaten.

28:50.310 --> 28:51.110
Here you go.

28:51.310 --> 28:52.110
Thank you.

28:59.000 --> 28:59.790
It tastes really good.

28:59.880 --> 29:01.790
Miss Ji, you're truly appreciative.

29:01.790 --> 29:03.160
No wonder Yuanzhong likes you.

29:08.790 --> 29:10.960
Here, let me show you something interesting.

29:12.590 --> 29:13.240
I bought this yesterday

29:13.240 --> 29:14.680
when I was at the market.

29:14.680 --> 29:15.550
This paper crane

29:15.550 --> 29:17.830
can fly without any magic skills.

29:18.000 --> 29:19.400
Besides, it's coated with Tung Oil,

29:19.400 --> 29:20.680
so it won't get wet in the rain.

29:20.920 --> 29:21.640
Isn't it amazing?

29:21.640 --> 29:23.110
There's a piece of iron inside.

29:23.350 --> 29:24.680
When the iron piece rotates,

29:25.000 --> 29:26.310
it has an energy-storing effect.

29:26.310 --> 29:27.200
When the energy is released,

29:27.200 --> 29:27.830
it should be able to make

29:27.830 --> 29:28.880
the wings of this paper crane

29:28.880 --> 29:29.880
flap up and down.

29:29.920 --> 29:31.640
However, it should only work once.

29:31.640 --> 29:32.400
That's right.

29:32.790 --> 29:33.750
The merchant who sold it to me

29:33.750 --> 29:34.920
said the same thing.

29:37.510 --> 29:38.590
On my way into the city,

29:38.680 --> 29:39.790
in the mountains on the outskirts,

29:39.790 --> 29:41.400
I saw a huge stone tower.

29:41.400 --> 29:42.640
Black smoke was billowing from inside.

29:42.640 --> 29:43.960
Do you know what it is?

29:43.960 --> 29:45.070
We saw it on our way

29:45.070 --> 29:46.030
into the city as well.

29:46.030 --> 29:46.640
But we only

29:46.640 --> 29:47.830
caught a glimpse from afar.

29:48.240 --> 29:50.790
Is that some kind of workshop?

29:51.510 --> 29:53.110
That's a metallurgy workshop.

29:53.350 --> 29:54.680
It operates non-stop day and night,

29:54.680 --> 29:56.590
and there are many mines around it.

29:56.590 --> 29:58.030
They're all dug very deep.

29:58.070 --> 29:59.590
But those who are mining the mines

29:59.590 --> 30:00.590
are not humans.

30:00.590 --> 30:01.480
Instead, they are

30:01.500 --> 30:02.880
high-hanging iron hammers

30:02.880 --> 30:04.440
and constantly spinning iron shovels.

30:05.400 --> 30:06.510
I heard them call it

30:06.510 --> 30:08.400
the Thunderbolt Device.

30:09.310 --> 30:10.070
When we have the opportunity,

30:10.070 --> 30:11.200
we can go take a look.

30:12.050 --> 30:13.570
Have you been to the south of the city?

30:13.600 --> 30:14.680
That's currently

30:14.750 --> 30:16.270
the most prosperous area of Yandu.

30:16.440 --> 30:17.680
People there travel

30:17.720 --> 30:18.880
by stepping on a kind of

30:19.350 --> 30:21.440
small wooden board with two wheels,

30:21.510 --> 30:22.590
moving freely back and forth.

30:22.590 --> 30:24.400
It's even more convenient than using magic skills.

30:24.920 --> 30:26.440
On the eaves of many houses,

30:26.440 --> 30:28.510
there hangs a kind of huge black umbrella.

30:28.510 --> 30:29.550
It's said that those black umbrellas

30:29.550 --> 30:30.240
can collect

30:30.240 --> 30:31.550
heat from the sun

30:31.550 --> 30:32.720
to keep people warm.

30:33.480 --> 30:35.520
Wood and minerals are both limited resources,

30:35.590 --> 30:36.830
and when they burn,

30:36.900 --> 30:38.080
they release strange odors.

30:38.110 --> 30:39.070
I didn't expect

30:39.070 --> 30:40.550
them to start

30:40.550 --> 30:41.720
looking for alternatives so soon.

30:41.720 --> 30:42.310
Focus on eating.

30:42.310 --> 30:43.000
Indeed.

30:43.400 --> 30:45.070
It's truly a case of one day in the mountains,

30:45.090 --> 30:46.660
a thousand years in the world.

30:46.790 --> 30:47.880
Thanks to craftsmanship,

30:47.880 --> 30:48.920
now ordinary families

30:48.920 --> 30:50.590
can also live a good life.

30:51.110 --> 30:53.350
Compared to magic skills which depend more on innate talent,

30:53.370 --> 30:56.520
craftsmanship truly benefits all living beings.

30:56.700 --> 30:58.780
That Goddess Wushuang

30:58.800 --> 30:59.930
who's worshipped by the human race

31:00.020 --> 31:01.540
truly has immeasurable merits.

31:06.400 --> 31:07.200
Mr. Qi.

31:07.400 --> 31:08.440
It's Mr. Qi.

31:08.680 --> 31:09.720
Why is he here today?

31:09.720 --> 31:10.790
Mr. Qi?

31:12.240 --> 31:12.960
What?

31:12.960 --> 31:14.000
You... You know him?

31:14.000 --> 31:15.160
I've bought his paintings before.

31:16.110 --> 31:17.270
What a coincidence.

31:18.830 --> 31:19.640
Mr. Qi!

31:19.940 --> 31:20.740
Mr. Qi!

31:23.590 --> 31:25.790
Fu. Fu!

31:26.070 --> 31:26.880
Over here.

31:28.270 --> 31:30.110
How dashing.

31:34.240 --> 31:35.030
Come on.

31:35.050 --> 31:36.530
Let me introduce you to two good friends of mine.

31:38.160 --> 31:39.310
This is Fu,

31:39.330 --> 31:40.240
Fu Jiuyun.

31:41.000 --> 31:42.240
I met him on my way

31:42.240 --> 31:42.790
to Yandu.

31:42.790 --> 31:44.030
We've shared a table and had drinks together a few times.

31:44.030 --> 31:46.110
He's a man of refined taste.

31:46.240 --> 31:47.200
I wouldn't say refined.

31:47.200 --> 31:48.270
At most, it's just

31:48.440 --> 31:49.350
a way to entertain myself

31:49.350 --> 31:50.550
when I'm bored and free.

31:52.000 --> 31:52.920
This is Yuanzhong,

31:52.920 --> 31:54.160
a good friend of mine for many years.

31:54.510 --> 31:56.510
This is Miss Ji, Ji Tanyin.

31:56.510 --> 31:57.640
She's skilled in craftsmanship.

31:57.640 --> 31:58.640
I'm not exaggerating.

31:58.640 --> 32:00.200
Her skills are definitely among the best

32:00.200 --> 32:02.070
in Yandu.

32:03.410 --> 32:04.570
Ji Tanyin, right?

32:05.550 --> 32:06.680
What a beautiful name.

32:08.440 --> 32:09.240
Miss Ji.

32:09.730 --> 32:11.450
I am Fu Jiuyun,

32:11.480 --> 32:12.650
a painter.

32:12.790 --> 32:14.750
I live alone here in Yandu,

32:14.750 --> 32:16.350
without family, a wife, or children.

32:16.400 --> 32:17.830
Are you a craftsman, Miss Ji?

32:18.000 --> 32:19.880
To earn Mei Shan's praise,

32:19.900 --> 32:22.900
you must be highly skilled.

32:23.110 --> 32:23.920
As it happens,

32:23.940 --> 32:25.070
I'm recently

32:25.160 --> 32:27.000
quite interested in craftsmanship.

32:27.310 --> 32:29.310
I wonder if I might have the opportunity

32:29.310 --> 32:30.680
to visit you and seek your guidance?

32:34.270 --> 32:35.310
Fu. Fu.

32:35.310 --> 32:36.240
Come on, have a seat first.

32:36.240 --> 32:36.830
Have some wine.

32:36.830 --> 32:37.720
The wine here is quite good.

32:37.720 --> 32:38.750
It's refreshing and not too strong.

32:38.750 --> 32:40.000
Here, let me pour you some.

32:42.510 --> 32:43.790
Is your name Fu Jiuyun?

32:44.160 --> 32:44.960
That's correct.

32:45.200 --> 32:46.440
But the people downstairs just now

32:46.440 --> 32:47.750
all called you Mr. Qi.

32:47.750 --> 32:48.590
I've mentioned that

32:48.640 --> 32:49.790
I'm a painter.

32:50.000 --> 32:50.680
So this name

32:50.680 --> 32:51.960
is somewhat inconvenient.

32:51.960 --> 32:52.750
But of course,

32:53.000 --> 32:54.480
you can call me

32:54.690 --> 32:55.520
whatever you like, Miss.

32:55.550 --> 32:56.440
I bought a treasure basin

32:56.440 --> 32:57.750
from Qiju Pavilion before.

32:58.200 --> 33:00.270
The fish in the painting come to life when they encounter water,

33:00.640 --> 33:02.070
and return to being a painting when the water dries up.

33:02.550 --> 33:03.400
Mr. Xu, the shopkeeper, said

33:03.400 --> 33:04.960
it was Mr. Qi's work.

33:04.960 --> 33:07.640
You're referring to that painting of the swimming fish, right?

33:07.920 --> 33:08.720
That's right.

33:08.910 --> 33:10.150
Indeed, it was my creation.

33:10.720 --> 33:11.830
I didn't expect Mr. Xu

33:11.830 --> 33:12.830
to have sold that painting

33:12.830 --> 33:14.000
to you, Miss.

33:14.200 --> 33:15.270
In that case,

33:15.640 --> 33:17.160
we must be destined to meet.

33:17.750 --> 33:18.880
If you like it,

33:18.880 --> 33:20.960
I can give you a few more as gifts.

33:20.960 --> 33:22.880
I have many such paintings at my residence.

33:23.070 --> 33:24.110
Paintings of birds, beasts,

33:24.110 --> 33:26.030
court ladies, flowers, and plants–I have them all.

33:26.030 --> 33:27.110
If you have time, Miss,

33:27.200 --> 33:29.590
you're welcome to come and appreciate them at my place.

33:32.960 --> 33:33.750
Fu.

33:33.780 --> 33:35.690
Come on, let's drink.

33:39.880 --> 33:40.680
These past few days,

33:40.700 --> 33:42.390
the weather has suddenly become hot,

33:42.420 --> 33:43.180
hasn't it?

33:43.720 --> 33:44.510
Isn't it weird?

33:45.240 --> 33:46.030
Good wine.

33:47.160 --> 33:47.960
Fine wine,

33:48.750 --> 33:49.550
beautiful scenery,

33:50.480 --> 33:51.790
with a beauty by my side.

33:52.070 --> 33:52.880
Mei Shan.

33:53.200 --> 33:54.680
Knowing you as a friend

33:54.700 --> 33:55.940
is the greatest blessing

33:55.990 --> 33:57.560
of my life.

33:59.270 --> 34:00.440
Who would say otherwise?

34:00.640 --> 34:01.880
Come on, let me introduce you to

34:01.880 --> 34:02.750
this other friend of mine.

34:02.750 --> 34:04.110
I didn't introduce him properly earlier

34:04.110 --> 34:05.830
because I was afraid it might frighten you.

34:05.980 --> 34:07.430
This one is quite formidable.

34:07.510 --> 34:08.840
He's the nemesis of the War Demon

34:08.840 --> 34:10.670
and the pillar of the Youhu Clan,

34:10.670 --> 34:11.880
who broke through Pinghu Xianzhou

34:11.880 --> 34:13.000
with just one palm strike,

34:13.000 --> 34:13.920
the last remaining

34:13.920 --> 34:15.190
god in this world,

34:15.280 --> 34:17.360
Yuanzhong, the High Priest of the Youhu Clan.

34:17.550 --> 34:18.440
Impressive, isn't it?

34:18.460 --> 34:20.500
This one is actually his handmaiden.

34:20.630 --> 34:22.510
They are... You know.

34:22.510 --> 34:23.630
That kind of relationship.

34:24.230 --> 34:25.830
The owner of the Divine Left Hand,

34:26.510 --> 34:27.760
High Priest Yuanzhong.

34:28.040 --> 34:29.560
My apologies, my apologies.

34:30.230 --> 34:31.840
However, after the war between gods and demons,

34:31.960 --> 34:32.800
no god has set foot again

34:32.800 --> 34:34.760
in this mortal world.

34:36.070 --> 34:36.920
So, as for

34:36.920 --> 34:38.840
the claim of being the last god in the world,

34:39.400 --> 34:41.880
High Priest, do you agree?

34:41.960 --> 34:43.880
Is that painting in the dance house your work?

34:44.630 --> 34:45.440
Painting?

34:45.880 --> 34:46.800
The Goddess Painting.

34:49.920 --> 34:51.440
The figure in that Goddess Painting

34:51.760 --> 34:52.800
looks a lot like me.

34:53.550 --> 34:54.840
Have you seen me before?

34:55.690 --> 34:56.730
Not exactly.

34:56.840 --> 34:58.360
What do you mean by "not exactly"?

34:58.800 --> 34:59.590
I mean

35:00.280 --> 35:02.030
we have never met in this world

35:02.230 --> 35:03.800
with these appearances.

35:08.110 --> 35:09.840
But I have seen you in my dreams,

35:11.800 --> 35:13.000
more than once.

35:16.230 --> 35:17.320
I wonder, Miss Ji,

35:17.800 --> 35:19.280
have you ever seen me in your dreams?

35:20.920 --> 35:22.710
Yuanzhong! Yuanzhong!

35:24.480 --> 35:26.280
Yuanzhong! Yuan... Yuanzhong!

35:31.400 --> 35:32.150
It seems someone here

35:32.150 --> 35:33.150
doesn't fancy my presence.

35:33.590 --> 35:34.400
Then I won't

35:34.960 --> 35:36.690
disturb your pleasant gathering any longer.

35:37.510 --> 35:38.320
Mei Shan,

35:39.670 --> 35:40.800
thank you for the invitation.

35:40.840 --> 35:42.360
Let's meet some other day.

35:42.760 --> 35:43.550
Miss Ji,

35:44.480 --> 35:45.400
until we meet again.

35:53.280 --> 35:54.950
I'll... I'll see him out.

36:02.310 --> 36:04.350
This is our shop's signature dish, Wealth Tree.

36:04.440 --> 36:06.070
Esteemed guests, please have a taste.

36:09.800 --> 36:10.590
Xiu.

36:10.670 --> 36:11.760
This isn't a gold bean.

36:11.760 --> 36:12.800
You can't eat it.

36:17.230 --> 36:18.360
What are you grunting about?

36:23.070 --> 36:24.150
Scholars and literati

36:24.150 --> 36:26.440
are just so carefree.

36:27.360 --> 36:28.150
Esteemed guests.

36:28.150 --> 36:29.630
There's a letter for Miss Ji.

36:31.110 --> 36:31.830
Don't open it!

36:33.190 --> 36:34.280
Tonight between 7-9 pm,

36:34.380 --> 36:35.530
at Rest Teahouse,

36:35.840 --> 36:37.140
I'd like to invite you there for a chat, beauty.

36:39.780 --> 36:41.570
I... I won't go.

36:41.840 --> 36:42.630
I won't go, either.

36:54.190 --> 36:55.030
Gentleman.

36:55.480 --> 36:56.510
What have you taken a fancy to?

36:56.800 --> 37:00.550
Who made this five-wheel fan?

37:01.760 --> 37:03.440
You have a good eye, Gentleman.

37:03.440 --> 37:04.360
This five-wheel fan

37:04.360 --> 37:06.630
was made by the Zhuang's of our Tongtian Workshop.

37:06.670 --> 37:07.800
Their five-wheel fans

37:07.800 --> 37:09.880
are exquisitely made, sturdy and durable.

37:09.880 --> 37:12.480
One person operating it can cool an entire room.

37:12.550 --> 37:14.920
It's most suitable for summer heat relief.

37:16.320 --> 37:18.590
This isn't Old Zhuang's craftsmanship.

37:19.400 --> 37:20.070
This...

37:20.960 --> 37:22.670
What do you mean by that, Gentleman?

37:23.000 --> 37:25.030
Are you accusing me

37:25.030 --> 37:26.400
of selling fakes?

37:26.630 --> 37:27.710
My Qiju Pavilion

37:27.920 --> 37:29.710
has been operating in Yandu for decades.

37:29.730 --> 37:31.710
What we rely on is honest business practices.

37:31.710 --> 37:32.980
Gentleman, you...

37:34.030 --> 37:35.400
That's not what I meant.

37:35.920 --> 37:37.150
I mean, this five-wheel fan

37:37.150 --> 37:38.440
has been modified by someone else.

37:38.840 --> 37:39.840
That person modified the connection point

37:39.840 --> 37:41.440
between the chain and the axle,

37:41.510 --> 37:42.920
making it easier to operate

37:42.960 --> 37:44.550
and increasing the wind power.

37:45.230 --> 37:46.960
Old Zhuang's craftsmanship is indeed exceptional,

37:46.960 --> 37:48.360
but he's not good at innovation.

37:49.110 --> 37:50.960
So this five-wheel fan

37:52.030 --> 37:54.240
can no longer be considered his work.

37:55.230 --> 37:56.320
I see.

37:58.030 --> 37:59.200
I misunderstood.

38:02.230 --> 38:04.150
Someone gave this to me.

38:04.880 --> 38:06.320
If I'm not mistaken,

38:07.400 --> 38:08.860
these two items

38:12.330 --> 38:14.920
should be crafted by the same person, right?

38:17.000 --> 38:19.630
Your discernment is truly impressive, Gentleman.

38:19.760 --> 38:22.030
These are indeed made by the same person.

38:22.110 --> 38:23.110
Who is this person?

38:23.110 --> 38:23.840
Well...

38:23.840 --> 38:25.070
Where does this person live?

38:25.070 --> 38:26.480
I only know it's a

38:26.480 --> 38:28.280
young woman surnamed Ji.

38:28.400 --> 38:29.820
As for where she lives specifically,

38:29.880 --> 38:30.920
I really have no idea.

38:31.960 --> 38:33.920
A young woman?

38:33.920 --> 38:34.710
That's right.

38:34.840 --> 38:36.880
This Miss Ji's craftsmanship is exceptional.

38:37.590 --> 38:38.400
In my opinion,

38:38.590 --> 38:40.630
she's even better

38:40.630 --> 38:42.230
than many famous master craftsmen.

38:44.920 --> 38:45.710
What?

38:46.030 --> 38:48.230
Do you have prejudice against women, Gentleman?

38:48.630 --> 38:49.720
That would be weird.

38:50.400 --> 38:51.400
Here in Yandu,

38:51.420 --> 38:53.820
we don't practice male superiority.

38:53.880 --> 38:55.150
As long as one is educated

38:55.150 --> 38:56.150
and has learned a craft,

38:56.150 --> 38:57.030
regardless of gender,

38:57.030 --> 38:59.000
they can make a living.

38:59.230 --> 39:01.510
After all, the ancestor of our craftsmanship,

39:01.920 --> 39:03.230
Goddess Wushuang,

39:03.550 --> 39:06.190
was also a woman.

39:06.600 --> 39:08.250
You've misunderstood, Sir.

39:09.440 --> 39:10.760
I'm just curious

39:11.220 --> 39:13.340
how such a young lady

39:13.370 --> 39:15.160
could have such remarkable skills.

39:16.630 --> 39:19.070
It's truly a case of the new generation surpassing the old,

39:19.230 --> 39:22.710
and the young outshining their predecessors.

39:23.360 --> 39:25.150
In that case, I apologize for my rudeness.

39:25.960 --> 39:26.800
Sir.

39:28.510 --> 39:30.590
If that young lady comes to your shop again,

39:31.000 --> 39:32.480
please keep her here.

39:33.070 --> 39:33.880
This...

39:34.030 --> 39:36.120
Just tell her someone admires her craftsmanship

39:36.250 --> 39:38.120
and wishes to meet her.

39:38.630 --> 39:39.590
That won't be difficult.

39:39.920 --> 39:41.280
Miss Ji comes to my shop

39:41.280 --> 39:42.800
every few days.

39:43.110 --> 39:43.960
However, I don't know

39:43.960 --> 39:45.510
where you live, Gentleman.

39:45.510 --> 39:46.670
If she comes,

39:46.710 --> 39:48.420
how should I find you?

39:48.450 --> 39:51.220
Just come find me at Master Yan's Mansion.

39:51.480 --> 39:52.440
Master Yan's Mansion?

39:53.320 --> 39:56.510
Guan Zhi, Master Yan's Mansion.

39:57.740 --> 40:00.010
Yan... Master Yan?

40:22.030 --> 40:23.000
What are you thinking about?

40:24.400 --> 40:25.090
You're here.

40:25.110 --> 40:26.400
You didn't hear me knocking just now,

40:26.510 --> 40:27.800
so I came in directly.

40:30.880 --> 40:32.070
That guy's identity is suspicious.

40:32.190 --> 40:33.440
You're not allowed to meet him.

40:35.110 --> 40:35.920
I won't go.

40:36.030 --> 40:37.440
If you run into him outside,

40:37.710 --> 40:38.960
you're not allowed to talk to him either.

40:39.800 --> 40:40.960
If he speaks to me,

40:40.960 --> 40:42.400
am I not allowed to respond?

40:44.880 --> 40:46.070
I won't talk to him.

40:48.480 --> 40:49.960
Let's go eat.

40:50.590 --> 40:51.550
I'm not going.

40:54.320 --> 40:55.110
Why?

40:55.510 --> 40:56.360
I'm not hungry yet.

41:12.550 --> 41:13.280
What's this for?

41:13.280 --> 41:14.400
I'll go wash Xiu's feet.

41:16.680 --> 41:17.470
Wash his feet?

42:09.150 --> 42:13.710
[Ningrui Pavilion]
